"Use {focus} if it fits. You can add English to make your meaning clear."]}]},"questions":["Kumusta? How are you?","Sino ang kasama mo? Who is with you?","Ano ang pangalan mo? What's your name?","Sino ito? Who is in your pretend family photo?","Anong food ang gusto mo? What food do you like?","Anong drink ang gusto mo? What would you like to drink?","Ilan? How many people are coming?","Kailan? When shall we meet?","Saan ka pupunta? Where are you going?","Nasaan ang banyo? Where is the bathroom?","Anong ride ang gusto mo? How would you like to travel?","Hotel time! Ano ang kailangan mo? What do you need?","Shopping tayo! What do you want to buy?","Ano ang suot mo? What are you wearing?","Sa room mo, what can you see? Use pretend details.","Sa umaga, what do you do? That means in the morning.","Kumusta ang weather? What's the weather like?","Ano ang nakikita mo? What can you see outside?","Kumusta ka? How do you feel?","Anong masakit? What hurts in our pretend story?","Nag-aaral ka? Are you studying? Use pretend details.","Your turn! Ask me one simple question in Tagalog or Taglish.","Ano ang ginagawa mo? What are you doing?","Need help? Okay lang. Say what you need in Taglish.","Kumusta? What's new?"],"style":"absolute-beginner-taglish"}
